          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "7.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Find the coordinates of a point A, where AB is the diameter of a circle whose centre is (2, – 3) and B is (1, 4)."
